    "body": "It was pointed out to me that\r\n* https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/fetch/h1-parsing/lone-cr.window.js\r\n* https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/cross-origin-embedder-policy/header-parsing.https.html#L46\r\n\r\nhave conflicting expectations. The latter wants a lone CR to be treated as whitespace.",
